  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:102px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Abel-tukahst.jpg\" title=\"Abel Tukahst\"><img alt=\"Abel Tukahst\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"216\" src=\"/images/Abel-tukahst.jpg\" width=\"100\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Abel-tukahst.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Abel Tukahst</div></div></div>\n<p>Abel Tukahst teaches mage skills and can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a> near the <a href=\"/wiki/Obelisk\" title=\"Obelisk\">Obelisk</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Abel.27s_Quotes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Abel's Quotes </span></h2>\n<p><i>\"You see a long time ago... well.. what was I saying?\"</i>\n</p><p><i>\"If you will permit me the time, I will tell you a tale of.... oh...\"</i>\n</p><p><i>\"I will remember more later, I promise ...\"</i>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
